    [6089] = {
        achievementId = 6089,
        name = "Keep Rollin' Rollin' Rollin'",
        source = "Keep Rollin' Rollin' Rollin'",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Barrel damage scales with the character; use a suitable alt and control incidental damage.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Barrel damage scales with the character; use a suitable alt and control incidental damage.\n\n1. On an alt, choose Mists of Pandaria Chromie Time in Stormwind or Orgrimmar, then enter Stormstout Brewery on HEROIC. Recent Midnight reports succeeded around levels 60-69, including level 66; scaling varies. Bring healing and remove passive damage effects.\n\n2. At Ook-Ook, stop attacking and roll the moving Brew Barrels into him. Count twenty actual impacts. Avoid Ground Pound and heal between barrels. Let the barrel debuff expire between small sets if necessary: twenty simultaneous stacks are not required.\n\n3. After twenty impacts, kill Ook-Ook. If the first barrel nearly kills him, stop and use a lower-level Chromie Time character on another attempt. A low-level barrel rider can also bring a high-level friend to taunt and heal without attacking. Wicked Wikket is no longer a reliable way to prevent barrel damage.",
