    [6300] = {
        achievementId = 6300,
        name = "Upjade Complete",
        source = "Upjade Complete",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Several connected story chapters with separate local branches.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Several connected story chapters with separate local branches.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and use an Alliance character. The quest panel below selects this character's next incomplete quest; account achievement credit does not necessarily mean a fresh character has completed its prerequisites.\n\n2. Paw'don Village: Start The King's Command in Stormwind, report to the airship and complete the landing vehicle/battle. Rescue the troops, free the workers and finish Ga'trul's defeat before Onward and Inward. Do not fly straight to later Jade hubs on a fresh character.\n\n3. The Waterspeaking Ceremony: At Pearlfin Village complete the missing-admiral rescue, Kung Din and the jailbreak. Deliver the Pearlfin report, rations and elder's instruments; finish Spirits of the Water at the waterspeaking ceremony.\n\n4. The White Pawn: Complete all four SI:7 report visions by using their story controls. Visit Lorewalker Cho, prepare body/hue/potency ingredients, witness the vision and finish Anduin's Decision.\n\n5. Pearlfin Village: After the SI:7 rescue reports, take A Perfect Match and Bigger Fish to Fry, then finish both Let Them Burn and Carp Diem. The current criterion names Carp Diem rather than only the older suggested Let Them Burn endpoint.\n\n6. Dawn's Blossom: Follow the faction handoff to Welcome to Dawn's Blossom. Complete Quill of Stingers and the local hozen/Jade Witch errands. If an already completed chapter remains uncredited, relog before repeating work.\n\n7. Greenstone Quarry: After The Jade Witch, take All We Can Spare. Rescue the jade workers, recover the quarry's supplies and finish What's Mined Is Yours. Follow the underground passages instead of searching only the surface marker.\n\n8. Tian Monastery: Take Tian Monastery and meet the High Elder. Attend the banquet, complete both groundskeeper and martial training branches, endure the trials and finish Flying Colors with your eligible instructor. Its three reward versions are alternatives; relog if the chapter does not update.\n\n9. Terrace of Ten Thunders: Begin The Sprites' Plight from the Greenstone handoff, finish both sprite attacks and damaged simulacra, then collect ritual artifacts, wayward spirits and vessels. Complete To Bridge Earth and Sky and Pei-Back. Older comments call this same chapter Ruins of Gan-Shi.\n\n10. The Temple of the Jade Serpent: Take The Serpent's Heart and Love's Labor, then visit the temple. Finish the librarian's moth/page tasks, the scryer's vision and the rider/lighting errands before The Jade Serpent concludes the chapter.\n\n11. Nectarbreeze Orchard: Go directly to Nectarbreeze Orchard for An Air of Worry and its parallel hardware/survivor/fire tasks. Complete The Splintered Path and defeat Gormal in Maul Gormal. This independent hub can be missed while following the central story.\n\n12. The Battle for the Forest: After The Jade Serpent, return through Get Back Here! and complete An Unexpected Advantage plus Helping the Cause. Finish Last Piece of the Puzzle.\n\n13. Overcoming Doubt: Take The Seal is Broken after the forest battle and complete the faction's Emergency Response. Stay through the serpent's restoration scene and its final hand-in; the Alliance and Horde conclusions have different quest IDs.\n\n14. Finish each chapter's final hand-in and check its named criterion. The route keeps parallel errands and faction alternatives separate. If the current NPC is in a story phase, finish the active quest or use the campaign transport; flying to a later-phase map pin does not complete a vehicle, escort or vision objective.",
        stepCount = 14,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 84, x = 0.856, y = 0.32799999999999996, step = 1, label = "Stormwind - The King's Command" },
            { mapID = 371, x = 0.462, y = 0.9620000000000001, step = 1, label = "Paw'don Village - landing" },
        },
