    [6301] = {
        achievementId = 6301,
        name = "Rally the Valley",
        source = "Rally the Valley",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Several connected story chapters with separate local branches.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Several connected story chapters with separate local branches.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and use the character whose story progress you want to continue. The quest panel below selects this character's next incomplete quest; account achievement credit does not necessarily mean a fresh character has completed its prerequisites.\n\n2. Thunderfoot Fields: Start with Chen and Li Li at the eastern road, complete Pang's farm errands, the turnip/watermelon delivery and Miss Fanny's launches. Help the ranch, return the lamb, defeat Lupello and use the lariat for A Lesson in Bravery.\n\n3. Mudmug's Place: Follow Great Minds Drink Alike to Mudmug. Finish the named breeders, flowers/blood, virmen warren and stolen supplies. Accompany Li Li on her day out, complete Muddy Water and finish Broken Dreams.\n\n4. Chen's Masterpiece: Resume with Chen at Halfhill for Chen's Resolution. Complete ALL farmer/hops branches, Li Li's grain and better-barley errands, Mudmug's Great Water Hunt and Barreling Along escort. Deliver the hops and taste-test results, then finish The Emperor. Losing Mudmug on his escort can stall this chapter.\n\n5. The Stormstout Brewery: After The Emperor, go to the brewery for Knocking on the Door. Finish Clear the Way, The Fanciest Water and Barrels, Man, then complete Cleaning House. The outdoor quest story counts; merely clearing the dungeon does not.\n\n6. The Hidden Master: Take Lin Tenderpaw's branch, defend/evacuate Stoneplow and find Master Bruised Paw in Paoquan Hollow. Finish bamboo, wood and stone training, including the egg and mist errands, then Training and Discipline. The separate Krasarang students are not mandatory just for this Valley chapter.\n\n7. Nesingwary's Safari: Find Hemet at the southwestern safari and do both mushan and stalker mastery branches. Complete fox/stag follow-ups and Tortoise Mastery, then Parental Mastery. The first quest marker can be easier to see when approaching from Krasarang.\n\n8. Finish each chapter's final hand-in and check its named criterion. The route keeps parallel errands and faction alternatives separate. If the current NPC is in a story phase, finish the active quest or use the campaign transport; flying to a later-phase map pin does not complete a vehicle, escort or vision objective.",
