    [6351] = {
        achievementId = 6351,
        name = "Explore Jade Forest",
        source = "Explore Jade Forest",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Reveal the zone's named areas; flight turns this into a sightseeing route.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Reveal the zone's named areas; flight turns this into a sightseeing route.\n\n1. Track this exploration achievement and travel through every unchecked named subzone. Fly low enough for the subzone text/map reveal to register; merely viewing a map or passing high overhead may not reveal it.\n\n2. Visit Honeydew Village around 29,13. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n3. Visit Terrace of Ten Thunders around 40,13. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n4. Visit Tian Monastery around 41,21. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n5. Visit Camp Nooka Nooka around 25,37. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n6. Visit Grookin Hill around 25,48. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n7. Visit Greenstone Quarry around 46,29. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n8. Visit Emperor's Omen around 50,26. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n9. Visit Windward Isle around 65,30. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n10. Visit The Arboretum around 57,44. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n11. Visit Dawn's Blossom around 48,45. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n12. Visit Serpent's Heart around 47,60. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n13. Visit Temple of the Jade Serpent around 57,57. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n14. Visit Nectarbreeze Orchard around 40,73. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n15. Visit Slingtail Pits around 52,82. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n16. Visit Pearl Lake around 58,80. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n17. Visit Garrosh'ar Point around 46,90. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n18. Visit Dreamer's Pavilion around 52,91. Land or move farther into its named area until its achievement criterion ticks; the pin is a useful approach point, not a requirement to stand on an exact pixel.\n\n19. Check the remaining criteria and return only to missing areas. A zone story quest, dungeon completion or Safari capture does not replace revealing the subzone. All listed areas remain reachable in Retail.",
