    },
    [6536] = {
        achievementId = 6536,
        name = "Mighty Roamin' Krasaranger",
        source = "Mighty Roamin' Krasaranger",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Several connected story chapters with separate local branches.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Several connected story chapters with separate local branches.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and use an Horde character. The quest panel below selects this character's next incomplete quest; account achievement credit does not necessarily mean a fresh character has completed its prerequisites.\n\n2. Zhu's Watch: Start What's Eating Zhu's Watch? at the northern settlement, find Yi-Mo and cheer him up, gather the medicine and complete the forehead treatment. Finish Zhu's Despair after helping BOTH Ken-Ken and the local defenders. The Valley Ken-Ken breadcrumb is optional if the local start is available.\n\n3. Nayeli Lagoon: At Marista take the raft/lagoon tasks and kill Unga hozen until Confusing Treasure Map (80827) drops. Use the map from your bags to accept Buried Hozen Treasure, dig the beach's sand piles and complete it. This item-started quest, not simply finishing the visible raft quests, supplies the chapter criterion.\n\n4. Temple of the Red Crane: After Zhu's Watch follow Unsafe Passage to Crane Wing Refuge. Complete The Murksweats, Blinding the Riverblades and Tread Lightly, then Ahead on the Way, Sha Can Awe and Striking the Rain. Take In the House of the Red Crane, defeat the Sha of Despair in its quest phase and HAND IN.\n\n5. Thunder Cleft: Start Search Party at Thunder Cleft, investigate Poisoned!, collect Skitterer Stew and blind the attackers. Continue through the Mogu Agenda and Pools of Youth while gathering herbal remedies. Finish Life.\n\n6. Dawnchaser Retreat: After Thunder Cleft, take Going West/Going on the Offensive to Dawnchaser. Complete Re-Reclaim, The Greater Danger and For the Tribe, then The Mantid and The Stoneplow Convoy. Finish For Family.\n\n7. Finish each chapter's final hand-in and check its named criterion. The route keeps parallel errands and faction alternatives separate. If the current NPC is in a story phase, finish the active quest or use the campaign transport; flying to a later-phase map pin does not complete a vehicle, escort or vision objective.",
        stepCount = 7,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 418, x = 0.762, y = 0.07400000000000001, step = 1, label = "Zhu's Watch - local start" },
