    [6539] = {
        achievementId = 6539,
        name = "One Steppe Forward, Two Steppes Back",
        source = "One Steppe Forward, Two Steppes Back",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Several connected story chapters with separate local branches.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Several connected story chapters with separate local branches.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and use the character whose story progress you want to continue. The quest panel below selects this character's next incomplete quest; account achievement credit does not necessarily mean a fresh character has completed its prerequisites.\n\n2. Fire Camp Osul: Start A Foot in the Door with Taran Zhu at 71.1,56.6. Finish the chargers, yaks, pitch, cages and ballistas, defeat Jung Duk, then follow Suna to Hatred's Vice. Complete the four local errands and Yalia's ritual, exorcise the rangers and finish The Point of No Return. The credit comes after Hatred's Vice, not immediately after the fire camp.\n\n3. Mistlurkers in the Sumprushes: Take A Delicate Balance after the Suna chapter and meet Orbiss. Kill Dmong Naruuk, collect torches, summon BOTH Golgoss and Arconiss, remove Orbiss's spear and complete all three restoration errands. Kill Jahesh for Mists' Opportunity.\n\n4. On Hatred's Path: Take the Gao-Ran handoff, meet Taoshi behind the lines and finish deep-scouts, flared scentlayers and four scout recall orders. Help the injured Blackguards and recover limbs/citron. Gather sixteen dread orbs, use the Dragon Launcher on fifty mantid and defeat Norvakess.\n\n5. The Sha of Hatred: Continue the Gao-Ran route through Dusklight Hollow and bridge defense, then ride to Rensai. Deliver the crossbow bolts, complete both aerial and ground Voress'thalik encounters, look through the spyglass and defeat Korvexxis, Serevex and Rothek. Complete The Sha of Hatred inside the cave and hand in.\n\n6. Tai Ho's Investigation: At Shado-Pan Garrison take The Motives of the Mantid and Set the Mantid Back together. Collect all four clues and destroy weapons/supplies. Visit Ogo at Niuzao, recover all four statuette parts from mantid and complete The Terrible Truth in the catacombs. The later optional fear/peace errands are not the criterion endpoint.\n\n7. Finish each chapter's final hand-in and check its named criterion. The route keeps parallel errands and faction alternatives separate. If the current NPC is in a story phase, finish the active quest or use the campaign transport; flying to a later-phase map pin does not complete a vehicle, escort or vision objective.",
        stepCount = 7,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 388, x = 0.711, y = 0.5660000000000001, step = 1, label = "Taran Zhu - A Foot in the Door" },
            { mapID = 388, x = 0.491, y = 0.7120000000000001, step = 1, label = "Tai Ho - independent investigation" },
        },
        sources = { "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6539#comments" },
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6539",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6539#comments",
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-13",
    },
    [6540] = {
        achievementId = 6540,
        name = "Dread Haste Makes Dread Waste",
        source = "Dread Haste Makes Dread Waste",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Several connected story chapters with separate local branches.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Several connected story chapters with separate local branches.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests and use the character whose story progress you want to continue. The quest panel below selects this character's next incomplete quest; account achievement credit does not necessarily mean a fresh character has completed its prerequisites.\n\n2. The First Paragons: Start Falling Down at the eastern wall and take BOTH initial errands. Use the dragon gun on eggs, investigate the fighting, awaken Kil'ruk with the tuning fork and complete the sapfly/vengeful-spirit tasks. At Klaxxi'vess do all three clutch/relay tasks, awaken the paragon and finish A Cry From Darkness.\n\n3. The Might of the Klaxxi: Continue the paragon story through Duskroot Fen and the traitor, then Amberglow Hollow. Activate its resonating beacon, finish the two Stinging Trail errands and awaken Kaz'tik with the tuning fork. Escort him to his buried weapon and turn in Falling to Pieces.\n\n4. Taste of Amber: Visit Sunset Brewgarden and finish The Heavens Hum With War before looking for the Sacred Recipe scroll underground. Its Amber Vault entrance is at 53.6,15.5. Complete the shade, teeth and blade branches, Chen's two Stormstout stories, and the Rikkitun motherseed/dust/monster errands. Enchant the forked blade and finish Blood of Ancients.\n\n5. Like a Deck Boss: Take the Soggy's Gamble handoff, drink Mazu's Breath and do the otter/crab-pot introduction. Retrieve the charter, buoy the full pots and pull shark teeth, then help Ju Lien. Launch the Mist-Hopper Jr. and hit Jiao from all four sides; finish Mazu's Bounty.\n\n6. Finish each chapter's final hand-in and check its named criterion. The route keeps parallel errands and faction alternatives separate. If the current NPC is in a story phase, finish the active quest or use the campaign transport; flying to a later-phase map pin does not complete a vehicle, escort or vision objective.",
