        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Build a specific Pandaria faction to Exalted through quests or reputation items.\n\n1. Start at Bowmistress Li - Dread Wastes wall introduction. Follow Falling Down and Nope from the wall, rescue Lann, defeat Kree'zot and use the tuning fork to awaken Kil'ruk in Preserved in Amber. Complete Wakening Sickness and Ancient Vengeance, then The Klaxxi Council at Klaxxi'vess.\n\n2. Continue the paragon-rescue story and available Klaxxi dailies. Turn Dread Amber Shards in to Ambersmith Zikk or use Stolen Klaxxi Insignias; killing Heart of Fear bosses is not the ordinary faction-reputation route.\n\n3. At Revered buy and USE the faction's Grand Commendation from Ambersmith Zikk at Klaxxi'vess 55,35.5 before earning the remaining reputation. The item unlocks increased future gains; merely carrying it does nothing.\n\n4. During Pandaria Timewalking, check Mistweaver Xia on Timeless Isle for this faction's commendations as an alternative. Use them on the character whose reputation you are raising. Continue to EXALTED and verify this achievement; buying a mount is unnecessary for the reputation criterion.",
