        name = "The Golden Lotus",
        source = "The Golden Lotus",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Build a specific Pandaria faction to Exalted through quests or reputation items.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Build a specific Pandaria faction to Exalted through quests or reputation items.\n\n1. Start at Setting Sun Garrison. Use Zidormi at Vale 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Pandaria phase. Visit the remaining Setting Sun Garrison daily hub; the destroyed original Golden Pagoda campaign must not be treated as a current prerequisite.\n\n2. Complete the offered garrison dailies and kill eligible earlier-Vale enemies, checking the reputation combat-log gains. Stolen Golden Lotus Insignias are an alternative; do not farm Black Empire assault enemies assuming they grant the old faction.\n\n3. At Revered buy and USE the faction's Grand Commendation from Jaluu the Generous at the Alliance shrine 84.2,62.7 or Horde shrine 63.2,22 before earning the remaining reputation. The item unlocks increased future gains; merely carrying it does nothing.\n\n4. During Pandaria Timewalking, check Mistweaver Xia on Timeless Isle for this faction's commendations as an alternative. Use them on the character whose reputation you are raising. Continue to EXALTED and verify this achievement; buying a mount is unnecessary for the reputation criterion.",
