        name = "The Anglers",
        source = "The Anglers",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Build a specific Pandaria faction to Exalted through quests or reputation items.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Build a specific Pandaria faction to Exalted through quests or reputation items.\n\n1. Start at Anglers Wharf. Take the three offered daily assignments around the wharf. Learn Fishing where a quest requires it, and use the supplied bait, bombing device or special item for the actual objective.\n\n2. Finish and turn in the fishing/wharf jobs each daily reset. Ordinary catches alone do not raise The Anglers, and Nat Pagle's personal friendship is a separate bar.\n\n3. At Revered buy and USE the faction's Grand Commendation from Nat Pagle at 68.4,43.4 before earning the remaining reputation. The item unlocks increased future gains; merely carrying it does nothing.\n\n4. During Pandaria Timewalking, check Mistweaver Xia on Timeless Isle for this faction's commendations as an alternative. Use them on the character whose reputation you are raising. Continue to EXALTED and verify this achievement; buying a mount is unnecessary for the reputation criterion.",
