    },
    [6551] = {
        achievementId = 6551,
        name = "Friend on the Farm",
        source = "Friend on the Farm",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Repeatable gifts can replace much of the daily friendship grind.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Repeatable gifts can replace much of the daily friendship grind.\n\n1. Complete Farmer Yoon's farm introduction through Halfhill Market so farmer interactions are available. These are ten PERSONAL friendship bars, separate from The Tillers faction. Choose any one farmer to reach Best Friend.\n\n2. Search Dark Soil around the Heartland fields for repeatable gifts. Save each gift for one of the two farmers who prefers it; preferred gifts give more friendship than random hand-ins. The soil is a small outdoor ground object, not a crop you plant.\n\n3. Optional daily progress comes from the farmer's offered quest and bringing five of their favorite cooked food. Dark Soil gifts can be repeated without waiting for that daily, and a May 2026 report confirms the gift-farming route still works. Farmers may visit Halfhill instead of staying at their homes.\n\n4. Raise Old Hillpaw at 30.95,53.1 or when visiting Halfhill: preferred gift Blue Feather; favorite food Braised Turtle. Give the gift through the farmer's dialogue and check their individual friendship rank.\n\n5. Raise Ella at 31.8,58.36 or when visiting Halfhill: preferred gift Jade Cat; favorite food Shrimp Dumplings. Give the gift through the farmer's dialogue and check their individual friendship rank.\n\n6. Raise Farmer Fung at 48.28,33.86 or when visiting Halfhill: preferred gift Marsh Lily; favorite food Wildfowl Roast. Give the gift through the farmer's dialogue and check their individual friendship rank.\n\n7. Raise Fish Fellreed at 41.73,30.04 or when visiting Halfhill: preferred gift Jade Cat; favorite food Twin Fish Platter. Give the gift through the farmer's dialogue and check their individual friendship rank.\n\n8. Raise Chee Chee at 34.4,46.8 or when visiting Halfhill: preferred gift Blue Feather; favorite food Valley Stir Fry. Give the gift through the farmer's dialogue and check their individual friendship rank.\n\n9. Raise Jogu the Drunk at 53.6,52.6 or when visiting Halfhill: preferred gift Lovely Apple; favorite food Sauteed Carrots. Give the gift through the farmer's dialogue and check their individual friendship rank.\n\n10. Raise Sho at 29.4,30.6 or when visiting Halfhill: preferred gift Lovely Apple; favorite food Eternal Blossom Fish. Give the gift through the farmer's dialogue and check their individual friendship rank.\n\n11. Raise Tina Mudclaw at 45,33.8 or when visiting Halfhill: preferred gift Ruby Shard; favorite food Fire Spirit Salmon. Give the gift through the farmer's dialogue and check their individual friendship rank.\n\n12. Raise Haohan Mudclaw at 44.4,34 or when visiting Halfhill: preferred gift Ruby Shard; favorite food Charbroiled Tiger Steak. Give the gift through the farmer's dialogue and check their individual friendship rank.\n\n13. Raise Gina Mudclaw at 53.2,51.6 or when visiting Halfhill: preferred gift Marsh Lily; favorite food Swirling Mist Soup. Give the gift through the farmer's dialogue and check their individual friendship rank.\n\n14. Continue until 1 farmer is at Best Friend and the achievement completes. Exalted Tillers reputation does not automatically fill these personal bars, and a farm decoration reward is not an extra requirement.",
