        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A legacy boss kill; the selected raid difficulty must match.\n\n1. Outside the instance, right-click your character portrait and select Heroic raid difficulty. For the older raids also choose the legacy 10- or 25-player size. Enter Terrace of Endless Spring through the mapped entrance. Use a current high-level character rather than a Chromie Time leveling character.\n\n2. Defeat the three Protectors, Tsulong, Lei Shi and Sha of Fear in that order. The entrance is in The Veiled Stair, not at the Vale's Mogu'shan Palace. Your target is Lei Shi. Kill preceding bosses needed to reach it; clearing a different wing in Raid Finder does not award this difficulty-specific achievement.\n\n3. At Tsulong, damage his hostile night form or heal his friendly day form. For Lei Shi, use area damage to reveal Hide and kill animated protectors during Get Away/protection phases. If Heroic credit fails, check the actual instance difficulty; comments report success after switching between 10- and 25-player Heroic on a fresh weekly lockout and allowing bosses to engage before killing them.\n\n4. Confirm the named kill appears in the achievement criteria. Boss loot and repeat attempts are constrained by the raid's weekly lockout; do not expect resetting the instance to resurrect a boss already saved dead.",
        stepCount = 4,
        waypoints = { { mapID = 433, x = 0.486, y = 0.616, step = 1, label = "Terrace of Endless Spring - Heroic entrance" } },
        sources = {},
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6733",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6733#comments",
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-13",
    },
