        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Team battleground results and queue availability determine progress.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Team battleground results and queue availability determine progress.\n\n1. Open Group Finder > Player vs. Player and select Temple of Kotmogu from the available battleground queues. Enter through the queue; visiting its outdoor gate does not start a match. The map view shows the battlefield for planning rather than an invented physical quest pickup.\n\n2. Pick up available Orbs of Power, protect carriers in the central pit for stronger scoring and focus enemy carriers so your team can take their orbs. Replace fallen carriers promptly.\n\n3. Finish 1 winning match. Stay until the match result registers and check the achievement counter. Losses and merely entering the map do not count; the hundred-win totals accumulate across matches.",
        stepCount = 3,
        waypoints = {},
