        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Complete a legacy dungeon on the specified difficulty.\n\n1. Before entering Mogu'shan Palace, select Normal or Heroic dungeon difficulty. Travel to the entrance shown on the map.\n\n2. Finish Trial of the King, descend to Gekkan and defeat his entourage, then use the route back up to Xin the Weaponmaster.\n\n3. Check achievement credit after the final encounter. Collect the five Jade Quilen before finishing Xin if you also need Quarrelsome Quilen Quintet.",
