        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Clear the current legacy Heroic dungeon.\n\n1. Select Heroic dungeon difficulty before entering at the marked location.\n\n2. Use the Scarlet Halls portal in the Scarlet complex. Defeat Houndmaster Braun, Armsmaster Harlan and Flameweaver Koegler.\n\n3. Defeat the final boss and check credit. Keep all dogs alive through Braun for Humane Society, and let Harlan gather eight qualifying targets in Blades of Light for Mosh Pit.",
