        difficultyReason = "Clear the current legacy Heroic dungeon.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Clear the current legacy Heroic dungeon.\n\n1. Select Heroic dungeon difficulty before entering at the marked location.\n\n2. Enter current Scholomance at Caer Darrow and clear Instructor Chillheart, Jandice, Rattlegore, Lilian Voss and Darkmaster Gandling.\n\n3. Defeat the final boss and check credit. Take Professor Slate's potion before leaving if you need Polyformic Acid Science. Bring another player for Gandling's School's Out Forever achievement.",
