        difficultyReason = "Clear the current legacy Heroic dungeon.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Clear the current legacy Heroic dungeon.\n\n1. Select Heroic dungeon difficulty before entering at the marked location.\n\n2. Defeat Vizier Jin'bak, complete Commander Vo'jak's defense event, then defeat General Pa'valak and Wing Leader Ner'onok.\n\n3. Defeat the final boss and check credit. Prepare Return to Sender before attacking Pa'valak: a full-strength hit may kill him before you can collect bomb stacks. Obtain Tenwu's Resolve before finishing Ner'onok for Run with the Wind.",
