        name = "Working For a Living",
        source = "Working For a Living",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Earn 75 Pandaria skill points in 2 distinct primary professions.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Earn 75 Pandaria skill points in 2 distinct primary professions.\n\n1. Learn the Pandaria tier of your chosen primary professions from their Pandaria trainers. Open the profession window and select its Pandaria skill bar; newer expansion skill points are separate.\n\n2. For gathering professions, gather Pandaria nodes or skin eligible Pandaria creatures. For crafting, train the tier's recipes and make orange/yellow recipes, replacing them as they become green or grey. Reach 75 earned Pandaria points and check that profession's criterion.\n\n3. Complete 2 distinct primary professions. Cooking, Fishing and Archaeology are secondary professions and do not satisfy this primary-profession requirement.",
