        name = "Fish Tales",
        source = "Fish Tales",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Read a fixed collection of lore objects; no random drop is required.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Read a fixed collection of lore objects; no random drop is required.\n\n1. Track the named lore objects and RIGHT-CLICK/read each monument or scroll. Flying past, killing nearby enemies or completing ordinary zone quests does not replace reading it. The map dropdown separates the guide's different zones.\n\n2. Read Watersmithing near 66.01,87.52. Read the object at Moonwater Retreat; later comments correct older 63,88 coordinates.\n\n3. Read Waterspeakers near 61.2,34.6. Read the waterspeaker monument.\n\n4. Read Origins near 30.6,38.5. Inside Fallsong Village's largest building, behind Cournith Waterstrider's position.\n\n5. Read Role Call near 74.5,83.5. Read the monument near the southern village route.\n\n6. Check every object criterion. The exploration achievement completes on reading the final missing object; the mailed story-scroll turn-in to Lorewalker Cho is a separate Lorewalkers reputation reward. For Vale objects, choose Zidormi's earlier Pandaria phase if the assault hides them.",
        stepCount = 6,
