        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Read a fixed collection of lore objects; no random drop is required.\n\n1. Track the named lore objects and RIGHT-CLICK/read each monument or scroll. Flying past, killing nearby enemies or completing ordinary zone quests does not replace reading it. The map dropdown separates the guide's different zones.\n\n2. Read The First Monks near 35.7,30.5. Read the monastery-area object.\n\n3. Read Pandaren Fighting Tactics near 18.8,31.8. Read the western Valley monument.\n\n4. Read Victory in Kun-Lai near 63.1,40.8. Read the northern victory monument.\n\n5. Read Together, We Are Strong near 26,21. Use the earlier Vale if needed.\n\n6. Read Always Remember near 53,69. Read the memorial in the earlier Vale.\n\n7. Check every object criterion. The exploration achievement completes on reading the final missing object; the mailed story-scroll turn-in to Lorewalker Cho is a separate Lorewalkers reputation reward. For Vale objects, choose Zidormi's earlier Pandaria phase if the assault hides them.",
