        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Complete nine legacy Heroic dungeon finales.\n\n1. Select Heroic and clear Temple of the Jade Serpent, Stormstout Brewery, Mogu'shan Palace, Shado-Pan Monastery, Gate of the Setting Sun and Siege of Niuzao Temple. Use each entrance in the map dropdown.\n\n2. Travel to the Scarlet complex in Tirisfal Glades for current Scarlet Halls and Scarlet Monastery, then Caer Darrow in Western Plaguelands for current Scholomance. Finish their final bosses on Heroic too.\n\n3. Check all nine Heroic criteria. Normal clears and the original Classic dungeon versions do not replace these Pandaria Heroic completions. This meta requires ordinary clears, not every special Glory of the Pandaria Hero challenge.",
