        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Personally contribute eight thousand orb-scoring points over time.\n\n1. Open Group Finder > Player vs. Player and select Temple of Kotmogu from the available battleground queues. Enter through the queue; visiting its outdoor gate does not start a match. The map view shows the battlefield for planning rather than an invented physical quest pickup.\n\n2. Pick up an orb and move into the central pit with teammates. Holding an orb generates scoring ticks, with the center giving the strongest rate; the team's total scoreboard by itself is not your personal contribution.\n\n3. Continue carrying/scoring across matches until your achievement counter reaches 8,000. Use cover within the central scoring area and ask for protection. Avoid fighting outside with no orb, which contributes no carry ticks to this objective.",
