        name = "Can't Stop Won't Stop",
        source = "Can't Stop Won't Stop",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Kill one hundred enemies while you personally carry an orb.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Kill one hundred enemies while you personally carry an orb.\n\n1. Open Group Finder > Player vs. Player and select Temple of Kotmogu from the available battleground queues. Enter through the queue; visiting its outdoor gate does not start a match. The map view shows the battlefield for planning rather than an invented physical quest pickup.\n\n2. Pick up an Orb of Power and join your team. Stay alive with its increasing vulnerability and participate in killing enemies while the orb remains on YOUR character.\n\n3. Accumulate one hundred qualifying kills across matches, checking the counter. Kills made after losing the orb do not count here; killing an enemy carrier without holding an orb instead advances Blackout.",
