        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Four personal orb colors and four carrier kills must fit one match.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Four personal orb colors and four carrier kills must fit one match.\n\n1. Open Group Finder > Player vs. Player and select Temple of Kotmogu from the available battleground queues. Enter through the queue; visiting its outdoor gate does not start a match. The map view shows the battlefield for planning rather than an invented physical quest pickup.\n\n2. In one match, personally pick up each of Cyan, Purple, Green and Orange as in Four Square. Track the colors rather than treating four pickups of one color as four different orbs.\n\n3. During that SAME match, help kill at least four enemy orb carriers. Work with teammates to recover freed orbs and rotate missing colors. Finish both conditions before the result screen; progress from separate matches does not combine for this All-Star attempt.",
