        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Includes a hundred wins plus survival and single-match challenges.\n\n1. Open Group Finder > Player vs. Player and select Temple of Kotmogu from the available battleground queues. Enter through the queue; visiting its outdoor gate does not start a match. The map view shows the battlefield for planning rather than an invented physical quest pickup.\n\n2. Complete Four Square, Powerball, Blackout, Can't Stop Won't Stop, I've Got the Power, What is Best in Life and Temple of Kotmogu All-Star using their separate guides. Prioritize color pickups and carrier kills together when attempting All-Star.\n\n3. Continue to one hundred victories for Temple of Kotmogu Veteran. The other counters usually finish during that grind, but Powerball's ninety-second center hold may need a planned defensive team. Check all eight meta criteria rather than repeating an already-completed challenge.",
        stepCount = 3,
        waypoints = {},
