        difficultyReason = "Flip control within twenty yards of the depot, then finish the capture.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Flip control within twenty yards of the depot, then finish the capture.\n\n1. Open Group Finder > Player vs. Player and select Silvershard Mines from the available battleground queues. Enter through the queue; visiting its outdoor gate does not start a match. The map view shows the battlefield for planning rather than an invented physical quest pickup.\n\n2. Follow an enemy-controlled cart toward its depot but do not take control too early. Clear or displace defenders as it approaches the final twenty yards, where the cart circle overlaps the capture area.\n\n3. Move enough teammates inside the circle to flip it to your team at that late point, then stay for the depot capture. Capturing a cart you owned throughout the route advances other achievements, not this late takeover condition.",
