        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Be present for five cart captures in one match without dying.\n\n1. Open Group Finder > Player vs. Player and select Silvershard Mines from the available battleground queues. Enter through the queue; visiting its outdoor gate does not start a match. The map view shows the battlefield for planning rather than an invented physical quest pickup.\n\n2. Choose survivability talents and follow carts nearing their depots. You need to be inside the friendly capture circle at the moment of capture; personally flipping the cart from neutral is unnecessary.\n\n3. Move to another approaching cart after each capture and repeat until five have entered depots without your character dying. Escape a losing fight rather than trading a death. A recent Training Grounds report confirms the fifth capture CAN be the match-winning cart, superseding old contrary comments.",
