        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Win while denying every enemy cart capture.\n\n1. Open Group Finder > Player vs. Player and select Silvershard Mines from the available battleground queues. Enter through the queue; visiting its outdoor gate does not start a match. The map view shows the battlefield for planning rather than an invented physical quest pickup.\n\n2. Coordinate separate players to cover all active cart routes from the opening. Watch the longest branch as well as the fast lava route, and send help before an enemy-controlled cart reaches its depot.\n\n3. Win with ZERO carts delivered by the opposing team. Temporarily losing control away from a depot is recoverable; letting the cart complete an enemy capture is not. If one is delivered, continue helping your team win and attempt the shutout in a later match.",
