        name = "Greed is Good",
        source = "Greed is Good",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Overlap Berserking and the brief Restoration buff.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Overlap Berserking and the brief Restoration buff.\n\n1. Open Group Finder > Player vs. Player and select Silvershard Mines from the available battleground queues. Enter through the queue; visiting its outdoor gate does not start a match. The map view shows the battlefield for planning rather than an invented physical quest pickup.\n\n2. Locate the battleground's Berserking and Restoration buff pickups before collecting either. Take Berserking FIRST, because it lasts longer.\n\n3. Immediately travel to a Restoration pickup and collect it while Berserking remains active. Restoration lasts only a few seconds, so the reverse order is much harder. Check both buffs overlap on your character; taking them separately after one expires is insufficient.",
