        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Nine objectives include a hundred wins and five different routes in one match.\n\n1. Open Group Finder > Player vs. Player and select Silvershard Mines from the available battleground queues. Enter through the queue; visiting its outdoor gate does not start a match. The map view shows the battlefield for planning rather than an invented physical quest pickup.\n\n2. Complete The Long Riders, Mine Cart Courier, End of the Line, Mine Mine Mine, Five for Five, My Diamonds and Your Rust, Escort Service and Greed is Good using the individual guides. Plan the five-route match and zero-enemy-capture match with teammates.\n\n3. Keep playing to one hundred Silvershard victories. Current Training Grounds comments confirm several capture, kill and win criteria count there; check your actual achievement ticks after a round. All nine listed components, rather than just a winning match, are needed for this meta.",
