        name = "Monkey in the Middle",
        source = "Monkey in the Middle",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Legacy scenario objective: Unga Ingoo.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Legacy scenario objective: Unga Ingoo.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select Unga Ingoo from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. Complete the escort and brew stage to summon Captain Ook. Let him disembark and walk several steps toward the cauldron; killing him on the boat or immediately at its edge can fail to initialize achievement credit.\n\n3. Keep him away from the tossed orange, intercept or move it if needed, and kill him before he reaches one. A high-level character can finish him after his shore encounter starts without waiting through another orange cycle.\n\n4. Confirm the achievement at his death. If combining Monkey See, Monkey Kill, also ensure his optional-boss criterion ticks before leaving.",
