        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Legacy scenario objective: Unga Ingoo.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select Unga Ingoo from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. Escort Brewmaster Bo to his cauldron. Collect Jungle Brew from the island's kegs and deliver it while preventing thieves from draining the cauldron. Once the brew stage finishes, let Captain Ook leave his boat and defeat him on shore.\n\n3. Finish every stage until the scenario-complete banner appears and check the achievement. For another attempt, leave the instance and ask the storyteller for the same story again; raid weekly loot lockouts do not govern ordinary scenario completion.",
