    [7258] = {
        achievementId = 7258,
        name = "Party of Six",
        source = "Party of Six",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Legacy scenario objective: A Brewing Storm.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Legacy scenario objective: A Brewing Storm.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select A Brewing Storm from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. Keep all six Thunderpaw Guardians alive during the escort. Clear every pursuing enemy before starting the final fight and let the friendly group leave combat so their health can reset.\n\n3. Engage Borokhula and immediately take aggro from his adds. Kill the attackers before they reach the guardians, then finish the boss. With a group, two players can use the special action on the same add to kill it and reset that action's cooldown while another handles the boss.\n\n4. Check that all six survived at scenario completion. If a guardian died earlier, the final boss's quick death does not repair the failed run.",
