        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Legacy scenario objective: Greenstone Village.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select Greenstone Village from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. Rescue the trapped villagers, return six stolen brew kegs and escort the rescued allies through the village. Clear the attackers, then defeat Vengeful Hui. Do not confuse visiting outdoor Greenstone with completing this instanced story.\n\n3. Finish every stage until the scenario-complete banner appears and check the achievement. For another attempt, leave the instance and ask the storyteller for the same story again; raid weekly loot lockouts do not govern ordinary scenario completion.",
