        name = "Perfect Delivery",
        source = "Perfect Delivery",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Legacy scenario objective: Greenstone Village.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Legacy scenario objective: Greenstone Village.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select Greenstone Village from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. Before touching a stolen keg, kill every enemy beside it and along the entire return path. Do this for all six kegs so nothing can damage a carrier during delivery.\n\n3. Carry/roll each keg back to the destination without taking enemy hits. Multiple party members may split deliveries; one person does not have to return all six. If an enemy remains, drop or delay the carry and clear it first.\n\n4. Confirm the sixth intact delivery. A later clean carry does not undo damage to an earlier keg in the same attempt.",
