        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Legacy scenario objective: Arena of Annihilation.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select Arena of Annihilation from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. Complete the arena's successive bouts until the randomly chosen final challenger. Defeat Cloudbender Kobo, Maki Waterblade or Satay Byu, whichever appears, and check that name in the achievement.\n\n3. Leave and re-enter for another full run until all three final challengers have been defeated. You cannot choose the final opponent, and repeated appearances of one are random rather than a sign you selected the wrong queue.",
