        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Legacy scenario objective: Arena of Annihilation.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Legacy scenario objective: Arena of Annihilation.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select Arena of Annihilation from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. Reach Little Liuyang's bout and keep all players away from her Flame Walls. Follow the safe openings if she starts the wall phase rather than walking through the fire.\n\n3. A current high-level character can kill her before the timed wall cast begins; the ability is not an unavoidable health-threshold trigger. Defeat her with nobody hit, then finish any remaining arena bouts if desired.",
