        name = "Fancy Footwork",
        source = "Fancy Footwork",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Legacy scenario objective: Crypt of Forgotten Kings.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Legacy scenario objective: Crypt of Forgotten Kings.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select Crypt of Forgotten Kings from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. At the Abomination of Anger, keep moving and watch the red clouds that appear beneath players. You have a brief warning to leave a new cloud before it deals damage.\n\n3. Kite the boss into clean space and defeat it without any party member taking red-cloud damage. A fast high-level kill avoids most casts; if waiting for another objective, continue moving rather than standing on the spawn point.",
