    [7281] = {
        achievementId = 7281,
        name = "Lost and Found",
        source = "Lost and Found",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Rare spawns and one-time discovery flags control progress.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Rare spawns and one-time discovery flags control progress.\n\n1. Find 1 DIFFERENT rare lost treasures from the equipment/unique-item family. These are rare outdoor spawns, unlike the ordinary grey-item Treasures of Pandaria. Loot or accept the item yourself; buying it from another player does not flag your treasure discovery.\n\n2. Search for Ancient Jinyu Staff at 47.1,67.4. Underwater; also search 46.2,71.2 and 44.9,64.6. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n3. Search for Ancient Pandaren Mining Pick at 46.1,29.1. Inside Greenstone Quarry; also search 44.1,27 and 43.8,30.7 underground. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n4. Search for Hammer of Ten Thunders at 43,11.6. Search the ruins around 41.8,17.6, 40.2,13.7 and 41.2,13.8 too. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n5. Search for Jade Warrior Statue at 39.26,46.65. Interact with the rare friendly treasure NPC. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n6. Search for Wodin's Mantid Shanker at 39.4,7.3. Loot the treasure at the northern wreck area. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n7. Search for Ghostly Pandaren Fisherman at 46.8,24.6. Speak with the faint friendly ghost and accept his charm; do not attack him. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n8. Search for Ghostly Pandaren Craftsman at 45.4,38.2. Speak with the friendly ghost for the Ancient Pandaren Woodcutter. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n9. Search for Cache of Pilfered Goods at 43.5,37.4. Find the equipment cache underground; this is NOT the grey-item Virmen Treasure Cache. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n10. Search for Staff of the Hidden Master at 15.4,29.1. Search Paoquan Hollow's other reported sites: 17.5,35.7; 19.1,37.9; 15,33.7; 19,42.5. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n11. Search for Equipment Locker at 42.3,92. Search the southern offshore area and loot its equipment. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n12. Search for Pandaren Fishing Spear at 50.8,49.3. Loot the spear from its outdoor treasure spawn. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n13. Search for Barrel of Banana Infused Rum at 52.3,88.7. On the southern Unga Ingoo island; loot the barrel rather than entering the Unga scenario. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n14. Search for Hozen Warrior Spear at 51.5,74. Loot the spear at the hozen treasure site. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n15. Search for Stash of Yaungol Weapons at 71.2,62.6. Also search 70,63.8 around the camp. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n16. Search for Tablet of Ren Yun at 44.7,52.4. Search the Brewfather mountain shrine area. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n17. Search for Sprite's Cloth Chest at 74.7,74.9. Loot the equipment chest, not a similarly named gold-only treasure. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n18. Search for Frozen Trail Packer at 35.2,76.3. Enter the cave and loot the frozen packer for Kafa Press. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n19. Search for Yaungol Fire Carrier at 66.3,44.7. Also search 66.8,48 around Fire Camp Osul. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n20. Search for Blade of the Poisoned Mind at 28.8,41.9. Rare Klaxxi weapon treasure. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n21. Search for Blade of the Prime at 66.8,63.8. Rare Klaxxi weapon treasure. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n22. Search for Bloodsoaked Chitin Fragment at 25.9,50.3. Rare Klaxxi treasure; check the object rather than farming nearby enemies. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n23. Search for Dissector's Staff of Mutation at 30.2,90.8. Rare southern-island weapon treasure. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n24. Search for Amber Encased Necklace at 33,30.1. Rare amber treasure. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n25. Search for Malik's Stalwart Spear at 48.7,30. Rare weapon treasure near the clutch grounds. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n26. Search for Swarming Cleaver of Ka'roz at 56.8,77.6. Rare weapon treasure. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n27. Search for Wind-Reaver's Dagger of Quick Strikes at 71.8,36.1. Rare weapon treasure. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n28. Search for Swarmkeeper's Medallion at 54.2,56.4. Rare Klaxxi treasure. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n29. Search for Glinting Rapana Whelk at 42,62.2. Search 42.2,63.6 and 41.6,64.6 around the island as well. This is an optional route candidate; already-claimed treasures or an empty spawn need not be camped before checking another.\n\n30. Check your discovery total and stop when 1 distinct finds are credited. Twenty out of the available candidates is enough for Relic Hunter. Recent 2026 comments report multi-hour waits for Klaxxi treasures, so do not promise the old forty-five-minute respawn or remove them merely because their spawn is empty.",
