        source = "In a Trail of Smoke",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Complete cloud-serpent training and fly the race accurately.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete cloud-serpent training and fly the race accurately.\n\n1. Complete the hatchling introduction, They Grow Like Weeds and all three Flight Training lessons with Instructor Windblade. The Sky Race daily (30152) can then appear; reputation alone does not replace the training quests.\n\n2. Accept the race at the Arboretum, mount the offered serpent and wait for the start signal. Use the checkpoint pins as a course overview, but follow the actual numbered race flags in order rather than the map's nearest-pin sorting.\n\n3. Pass all ten checkpoints, taking nearby smoke/cloud rings for Fleet Winds speed stacks. Cut directly toward the next checkpoint instead of tracing the NPC racers' wider curves. Refresh the buff with another cloud ring before it expires.\n\n4. Cross the finish with TEN Fleet Winds stacks still active. Collecting a cloud at ten refreshes its duration. Winning first place is a separate achievement; focus on maintaining the full buff through the finish.",
        stepCount = 4,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 371, x = 0.5770000000000001, y = 0.45, step = 1, label = "Elder Anli - training prerequisites" },
