        difficultyReason = "Harvest a special seed crop after unlocking its sale.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Harvest a special seed crop after unlocking its sale.\n\n1. Unlock Sunsong Ranch and reach Revered with The Tillers. Merchant Greenfield then sells special seeds, including Songbell and profession-material varieties; Sho's friendship can provide another special-seed source.\n\n2. Plant a SPECIAL seed in a tilled plot, fix its tending condition and let it mature through the growth reset. Harvest it yourself and check the achievement; an ordinary vegetable crop or buying its product does not count.",
