        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Cook 30 different qualifying foods.\n\n1. Learn Sungshin Ironpaw's Everyday Cooking recipes at Halfhill, then unlock the six Ways. Track this achievement so you can distinguish foods already cooked from those still missing.\n\n2. Cook one each of the inexpensive vendor-ingredient recipes: Sliced Peaches, Toasted Fish Jerky, Pounded Rice Cake, Dried Peaches, Roasted Barley Tea, Red Bean Bun, Peach Pie, Pearl Milk Tea, Instant Noodles, Dried Needle Mushrooms, Yak Cheese Curds and Boiled Silkworm Pupa. Use the exact listed recipes in the achievement tracker.\n\n3. Add the trained fish dishes and first Way foods until 30 DIFFERENT criteria are complete. Buying or eating a finished food does not replace cooking it. You need only 30 of the listed recipes, so skip expensive or rare alternatives once enough are credited.",
        stepCount = 3,
        waypoints = { { mapID = 376, x = 0.536, y = 0.512, step = 1, label = "Sungshin Ironpaw - Halfhill cooking introductions" } },
