        difficultyReason = "Random archaeology projects from the specified race branches.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Random archaeology projects from the specified race branches.\n\n1. Learn Archaeology, unlock Pandaria dig sites and work the Mogu project branch. These are archaeology artifacts, not outdoor lore scrolls or bosses sharing their names.\n\n2. Restore each of these once: Manacles of Rebellion; Warlord's Branding Iron; Petrified Bone Whip; Anatomical Dummy. Clear whole dig sites, gather the matching racial fragments and complete the active project to roll another. Socket matching keystones when available to reduce fragment costs.\n\n3. Check every listed criterion after solving. If your first common is a pristine version and the ordinary-artifact criterion remains unchecked, keep solving for its normal version too. Turn pristine quest items in at the Seat of Knowledge for the separate pristine-display metas. Rare artifacts may take many projects to appear.",
