        name = "Theramore's Fall",
        source = "Theramore's Fall",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Legacy scenario objective: Theramore's Fall.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Legacy scenario objective: Theramore's Fall.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select Theramore's Fall from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. Use an Alliance character for this version. Follow the post-bombing assault through Theramore, clear the listed captains and defenses, and finish the final scenario stage. The ordinary scenario achievement is available; it is different from the closed pre-expansion event feat.\n\n3. Finish every stage until the scenario-complete banner appears and check the achievement. For another attempt, leave the instance and ask the storyteller for the same story again; raid weekly loot lockouts do not govern ordinary scenario completion.",
