        name = "Theramore's Fall",
        source = "Theramore's Fall",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Legacy scenario objective: Theramore's Fall.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Legacy scenario objective: Theramore's Fall.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select Theramore's Fall from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. Use a Horde character for this version. Destroy the required harbor defenses and siege engines, defeat the named defenders and rescue the captive at the end. Complete every scenario stage; this is the ordinary scenario achievement, not the retired pre-expansion event feat.\n\n3. Finish every stage until the scenario-complete banner appears and check the achievement. For another attempt, leave the instance and ask the storyteller for the same story again; raid weekly loot lockouts do not govern ordinary scenario completion.",
