    [7527] = {
        achievementId = 7527,
        name = "No Tank You",
        source = "No Tank You",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Legacy scenario objective: Theramore's Fall.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Legacy scenario objective: Theramore's Fall.\n\n1. At the Seat of Knowledge above Mogu'shan Palace, speak to Lorewalker Fu for NORMAL scenarios at Vale 83.2,30.6. Select Theramore's Fall from his stories and enter the legacy scenario. If the assault phase hides the storytellers, ask Zidormi at 81.2,29.6 for the earlier Vale. These storytellers allow solo entry; the old Dungeon Finder queue is unnecessary.\n\n2. Use the Alliance scenario and clear the other objectives in the siege-engine stage BEFORE killing Gatecrusher. For Horde this includes destroying the other three siege engines, leaving Big Bessa as the final stage objective.\n\n3. Dismiss pets for the safest attempt, avoid the engine's frontal ram and move away from marked ranged impacts. Kill Gatecrusher without anyone being hit by its ram or stone-thrower. Killing it before the other stage objectives can prevent credit even if nobody took damage.",
